    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.1.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Predator visual systems differ from human or camera colour spaces.", "Published experimental datasets cover selected conspicuous systems.";
